'''buddhahood''' (bö′dạ̈-hu̇d), ''n.'' [< ''buddha'' + ''-hood''.] The state or condition of a buddha. See ''Buddha'' and ''Buddhism''.

'''buddhaship''' (bö′dạ̈-ship), ''n.'' [< ''buddha'' + ''-ship''.] The condition of one who has attained enlightenment and become a buddha. See ''Buddha'' and ''Buddhism''.

